# coopiano for WebCLAP

coopiano by Peter Cooper, a physically modelled piano (hammer, strings, soundboard, sympathetic resonance and room),
ported to WebCLAP. This is not an official coopiano release.

- coopiano: https://github.com/peterc/coopiano (commit bba9e06)
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-coopiano.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

